const ADDONS={"core3":{"id":"core3","name":"Core 3× / week","icon":"🎯","description":"9 direct core sets per week added to Mon/Wed/Fri.","schedule":{"Mon":[{"name":"Cable Crunch","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest":75,"priority":90,"machine":"","notes":"Core add-on"}],"Wed":[{"name":"Hanging Knee Raise","sets":3,"reps":"8–15","rest":75,"priority":90,"machine":"","notes":"Core add-on"}],"Fri":[{"name":"Ab Wheel Rollout","sets":3,"reps":"6–12","rest":75,"priority":90,"machine":"","notes":"Core add-on"}]}},"traps":{"id":"traps","name":"Traps","icon":"🔺","description":"Extra direct trap work twice per week.","schedule":{"Tue":[{"name":"Dumbbell Shrug","sets":3,"reps":"10–15","rest":90,"priority":91,"machine":"","notes":"Trap add-on"}],"Thu":[{"name":"Cable Shrug","sets":2,"reps":"12–15","rest":75,"priority":91,"machine":"","notes":"Trap add-on"}]}},"forearms":{"id":"forearms","name":"Forearms & Grip","icon":"✊","description":"Grip and forearm work twice per week.","schedule":{"Tue":[{"name":"Farmer's Carry","sets":3,"reps":"30–45 sec","rest":90,"priority":92,"machine":"","notes":"Grip add-on"}],"Fri":[{"name":"Reverse Wrist Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–20","rest":60,"priority":92,"machine":"","notes":"Forearm add-on"},{"name":"Seated Wrist Curl","sets":2,"reps":"12–20","rest":60,"priority":93,"machine":"","notes":"Forearm add-on"}]}},"calves":{"id":"calves","name":"Extra Calves","icon":"🦵","description":"One additional calf session each week.","schedule":{"Fri":[{"name":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":3,"reps":"12–20","rest":75,"priority":94,"machine":"","notes":"Calf add-on"}]}},"shoulder_health":{"id":"shoulder_health","name":"Shoulder Health","icon":"🛡️","description":"Light rotator-cuff work twice per week.","schedule":{"Mon":[{"name":"Cable External Rotation","sets":2,"reps":"12–20","rest":45,"priority":95,"machine":"","notes":"Shoulder health"}],"Thu":[{"name":"Band External Rotation","sets":2,"reps":"15–20","rest":45,"priority":95,"machine":"","notes":"Shoulder health"}]}}};
const DAYS=["Sun","Mon","Tue","Wed","Thu","Fri","Sat"];

const K={
 customs:"aj_v5_custom_programs",activeProgram:"aj_v5_active_program",history:"aj_v5_history",
 machine:"aj_v5_machine_memory",addons:"aj_v5_addons",activeWorkout:"aj_v5_active_workout",
 prefs:"aj_v5_prefs",init:"aj_v5_initialized"
};

function clone(x){return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(x))}
function safeJSON(k,def){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(k)||"null")??def}catch(e){return def}}
function save(k,v){localStorage.setItem(k,JSON.stringify(v))}
function esc(s){return String(s??"").replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;",'"':"&quot;","'":"&#039;"}[c]))}
function num(v){let n=parseFloat(String(v).replace(",","."));return Number.isFinite(n)?n:0}
function range(s){let m=String(s).match(/(\d+)\D+(\d+)/);return m?[+m[1],+m[2]]:[8,12]}
function uid(prefix="p"){return prefix+"_"+Date.now()+"_"+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7)}
function toast(s){$("toast").textContent=s;$("toast").classList.add("show");setTimeout(()=>$("toast").classList.remove("show"),1900)}
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);

let customs=safeJSON(K.customs,{});
let activeProgramId=localStorage.getItem(K.activeProgram)||"";
let history=safeJSON(K.history,[]);
let machineMemory=safeJSON(K.machine,{});
let addonState=safeJSON(K.addons,{});
let prefs=Object.assign({increment:2.5,targetRir:2,compoundRest:null,isolationRest:null},safeJSON(K.prefs,{}));
let activeWorkout=safeJSON(K.activeWorkout,null);
let activeDay=DAYS[new Date().getDay()];
let timer=null,timerLeft=0,timerTotal=0,timerPaused=false,timerNext=null;

function migrateV4(){
 if(localStorage.getItem(K.init))return;
 const oldPlan=safeJSON("mts_v4_plan",null)||clone(BUILTINS.original_5day.schedule);
 const oldHist=safeJSON("mts_v4_history",[]);
 const oldPrefs=safeJSON("mts_v4_prefs",null);
 const id="my_5day";
 customs[id]={
  id,name:"My 5-Day Split",icon:"🏋️",category:"Saved Plan",weeks:"Ongoing",
  goal:"Your saved 5-day Chest / Back / Legs / Shoulders / Arms plan. It remains separate from every other program.",
  locked:false,source:"original_5day",schedule:oldPlan,coach:clone(BUILTINS.original_5day.coach)
 };
 activeProgramId=id;
 if(!history.length&&oldHist.length)history=oldHist.map(h=>Object.assign({programId:id,programName:"My 5-Day Split"},h));
 if(oldPrefs)prefs=Object.assign(prefs,oldPrefs);
 for(const d of DAYS){
  const old=safeJSON("mt_day_"+d,null);
  if(Array.isArray(old))for(const e of old)if(e.name&&(e.machine||e.notes))machineMemory[e.name]={machine:e.machine||"",notes:e.notes||""};
  const oldBlock=oldPlan?.[d]?.exercises||[];
  for(const e of oldBlock)if(e.name&&(e.machine||e.notes))machineMemory[e.name]={machine:e.machine||"",notes:e.notes||""};
 }
 // Add abs/core to the current saved plan, but keep the locked Original untouched.
 addonState[id]={core3:true};
 save(K.customs,customs);save(K.history,history);save(K.machine,machineMemory);save(K.addons,addonState);save(K.prefs,prefs);
 localStorage.setItem(K.activeProgram,activeProgramId);localStorage.setItem(K.init,"1");
}
migrateV4();

function getProgram(id=activeProgramId){return customs[id]||BUILTINS[id]||BUILTINS.original_5day}
function activeProgram(){return getProgram()}
function programCoach(){
 const base=Object.assign({},activeProgram().coach||{});
 return {
  targetRir:prefs.targetRir!==null&&prefs.targetRir!==undefined?prefs.targetRir:(base.targetRir??2),
  compoundRest:prefs.compoundRest!==null&&prefs.compoundRest!==undefined?prefs.compoundRest:(base.compoundRest??150),
  isolationRest:prefs.isolationRest!==null&&prefs.isolationRest!==undefined?prefs.isolationRest:(base.isolationRest??90),
  mode:base.mode||"hypertrophy",
  increment:prefs.increment||2.5
 }
}
function isLocked(){return !customs[activeProgramId]}
function lib(name){return LIBRARY.find(x=>x.name===name)||{name,day:"Custom",primary:"Custom",pattern:"custom",kind:"isolation",equipment:"Custom",tip:"Use controlled technique and a pain-free range of motion."}}
function isTimedKind(kind){return kind==="cardio"||kind==="mobility"}
function isResistance(ex){let k=lib(ex.name).kind;return !isTimedKind(k)}
function dayBlock(program,day){return program.schedule[day]||{name:"Rest",exercises:[]}}

function ensureAddonState(id=activeProgramId){if(!addonState[id])addonState[id]={};return addonState[id]}
function addonExercises(day,id=activeProgramId){
 let st=ensureAddonState(id),arr=[];
 for(const [aid,a] of Object.entries(ADDONS))if(st[aid]&&a.schedule[day])arr.push(...a.schedule[day].map(x=>Object.assign(clone(x),{_addon:true,_addonId:aid})));
 return arr
}
function effectivePlanExercises(day,id=activeProgramId){
 let p=getProgram(id),base=clone(dayBlock(p,day).exercises||[]),arr=base.concat(addonExercises(day,id));
 return arr.map((e,i)=>{let mem=machineMemory[e.name]||{};return Object.assign({priority:i+1,machine:"",notes:""},e,{machine:mem.machine||e.machine||"",notes:mem.notes||e.notes||""})})
}

function currentExercises(){
 if(activeWorkout&&activeWorkout.programId===activeProgramId&&activeWorkout.day===activeDay)return activeWorkout.exercises;
 return effectivePlanExercises(activeDay).map(e=>Object.assign(e,{rows:Array.from({length:Math.max(1,num(e.sets)||1)},()=>({weight:"",reps:"",rir:"",result:"",done:false}))}))
}

function lastRecord(name){
 for(const h of history){for(const e of h.exercises||[])if(e.name===name&&e.sets?.length)return e}
 return null
}
function e1rm(w,r){w=num(w);r=num(r);return w&&r?+(w*(1+r/30)).toFixed(1):0}
function bestHistoricalE1RM(name){
 let best=0;for(const h of history)for(const e of h.exercises||[])if(e.name===name)for(const s of e.sets||[])best=Math.max(best,e1rm(s.weight,s.reps));return best
}
function targetRir(){let c=programCoach();return num(c.targetRir??2)}
function increment(){return num(prefs.increment)||2.5}
function roundLoad(v){let inc=increment();return Math.max(inc,Math.round(v/inc)*inc)}
function lastText(rec){
 if(!rec||!rec.sets?.length)return "No previous performance yet.";
 return "Last: "+rec.sets.map(s=>`${s.weight||0}kg×${s.reps||0} RIR${s.rir===""?"–":s.rir}`).join(" · ")
}
function recommendation(ex){
 const L=lib(ex.name),prev=lastRecord(ex.name),read=activeWorkout?.readiness||"Normal";
 if(L.kind==="mobility")return {tag:"MOBILITY",weight:0,msg:"Move slowly, stay pain-free and use relaxed breathing.",last:prev?"Completed previously.":"No previous session yet."};
 if(L.kind==="cardio")return {tag:"CONDITIONING",weight:0,msg:L.pattern==="zone2"?"Stay at a sustainable conversational pace.":"Keep hard efforts repeatable; do not exhaust yourself in the first interval.",last:prev?"Previous session saved.":"No previous session yet."};
 const [lo,hi]=range(ex.reps),sets=(prev?.sets||[]).filter(s=>num(s.reps)>0);
 if(!sets.length)return {tag:"BASELINE",weight:0,msg:`Choose a load for ${lo}–${hi} clean reps around RIR ${targetRir()}.`,last:"No previous weighted performance yet."};
 let weighted=sets.filter(s=>num(s.weight)>0);
 if(!weighted.length){
  let reps=sets.map(s=>num(s.reps)),allTop=reps.every(r=>r>=hi);
  return {tag:allTop?"PROGRESS":"BUILD REPS",weight:0,msg:allTop?`You reached the top of the range. Add a small load or choose a harder variation next time.`:`Beat your previous total reps while staying around RIR ${targetRir()}.`,last:lastText(prev)}
 }
 let base=Math.max(...weighted.map(s=>num(s.weight))),same=weighted.filter(s=>num(s.weight)===base),reps=same.map(s=>num(s.reps)),rirs=same.map(s=>s.rir===""?targetRir():num(s.rir));
 let avg=rirs.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/rirs.length,allTop=reps.every(r=>r>=hi),below=reps.filter(r=>r<lo).length;
 if(read==="Tired"){let w=roundLoad(base*.95);return {tag:"READINESS",weight:w,msg:`Tired today: use about ${w} kg and keep 2–3 reps in reserve.`,last:lastText(prev)}}
 if(allTop&&avg>=1){let w=roundLoad(base+increment());return {tag:"INCREASE",weight:w,msg:`Progress to ${w} kg. Aim for ${lo}–${Math.min(hi,lo+2)} clean reps around RIR ${targetRir()}.`,last:lastText(prev)}}
 if(below>=2||avg<.5){let w=roundLoad(base*.95);return {tag:"REDUCE",weight:w,msg:`Performance was below target. Use about ${w} kg and rebuild inside ${lo}–${hi} reps.`,last:lastText(prev)}}
 let total=reps.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);return {tag:"BUILD REPS",weight:base,msg:`Keep ${base} kg and beat ${total} total reps while staying near RIR ${targetRir()}.`,last:lastText(prev)}
}
function warmups(ex,w){
 const L=lib(ex.name);w=num(w);if(!w||L.kind!=="compound")return "";
 return [[.4,8],[.6,5],[.8,3]].map(x=>`${roundLoad(w*x[0])}kg×${x[1]}`).join(" → ")
}
function smartRest(ex,rir){
 const L=lib(ex.name),c=programCoach();
 let base=num(ex.rest);
 if(!base)base=L.kind==="compound"?num(c.compoundRest||150):num(c.isolationRest||90);
 if(num(rir)<=1&&isResistance(ex))base+=30;
 if(activeWorkout?.readiness==="Tired"&&isResistance(ex))base+=15;
 return base
}
function estimateMinutes(exs){
 let m=4;for(const e of exs){let L=lib(e.name);if(isTimedKind(L.kind)){let mt=String(e.reps).match(/(\d+)/);m+=mt?num(mt[1]):3}else m+=(num(e.sets)||1)*(.6+(num(e.rest)||90)/60)}return Math.round(m)
}
function applyTimeBudget(exs,mins){
 let used=4;return exs.map(e=>{let L=lib(e.name),est=isTimedKind(L.kind)?(num(String(e.reps).match(/(\d+)/)?.[1])||3):(num(e.sets)||1)*(.6+(num(e.rest)||90)/60);let optional=used+est>mins&&(num(e.priority)||50)>2;if(!optional)used+=est;return Object.assign(e,{optional})})
}
function performanceIndex(exercises){
 let vals=[];for(const e of exercises){if(lib(e.name).kind!=="compound")continue;let best=Math.max(0,...(e.sets||[]).map(s=>e1rm(s.weight,s.reps)));if(best)vals.push(best)}return vals.length?+(vals.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)/vals.length).toFixed(1):0
}
function deloadSignal(){
 let hs=history.filter(h=>h.programId===activeProgramId&&h.day===activeDay).slice(0,3);if(hs.length<3)return "";
 let tired=hs.filter(h=>h.readiness==="Tired").length,p=hs.map(h=>num(h.performance));
 if(tired>=2||(p[0]&&p[1]&&p[2]&&p[0]<p[1]*.98&&p[1]<p[2]*.98))return "Recent performance/readiness is trending down. Consider a deload: about 10% less load and 30–40% fewer work sets for one week.";
 return ""
}

